<td tEditID="c1r2" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r2" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in"><span style="mso-fareast-font-family:
&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial">Dear &lt;name&gt;,<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in"><span style="mso-fareast-font-family:
&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial"><br></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in"><span style="mso-fareast-font-family:
&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial">I’m excited to tell you about
changes we’re making to enhance your Red Cross partnership experience. Going forward, American Red Cross Account
support will be fulfilled by </span><span class="normaltextrun"><b><span style="mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-font-family:
Calibri;color:black;background:white">a cohesive team supporting your blood
program - a Strategic Business Planning team member to assist in building a
strong calendar of blood drives and an Account Manager to support traditional
blood drive planning and donor engagement.</span></b></span><span style="mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial"> &lt;She/he/they&gt;
will work with you until drive dates are confirmed, at which time the Account
Manager, &lt;name&gt;, will continue donor engagement, scheduling and Drive Day
preparation with you as usual. &lt;AM name&gt; specializes in ensuring a blood drive
is successful and will now have greater focus that allows examination of
processes and technologies to continue improving the drive experience for all.<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in"><span style="mso-fareast-font-family:
&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in"><span style="mso-fareast-font-family:
&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial">Planning a blood program calendar
as far out as possible ensures no patient is left without the blood they need
to survive trauma or illness. </span><span class="normaltextrun"><span style="mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-font-family:
Calibri;color:black;background:white">As a team, our goals are to maximize
turnout at your drives, enable your ability to build your annual blood program
and help impact more patient lives. <b>Our team is here to support you!</b></span></span><b><span style="mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-font-family:
Calibri;color:black;background:white"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in"><span style="mso-fareast-font-family:
&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in"><span style="mso-fareast-font-family:
&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial">You’re in good hands with &lt;name&gt;
and &lt;name&gt; as your Strategic Business Planning Manager and Account
Manager, and I hope you’ll enjoy the increased service. We’re so grateful for
your partnership!<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in"><span style="mso-fareast-font-family:
&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in"><span style="mso-fareast-font-family:
&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial">If you have any questions, don’t
hesitate to reach out. <o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in"><span style="mso-fareast-font-family:
&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in"><span style="mso-fareast-font-family:
&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial">Best Regards,<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in"><span style="mso-fareast-font-family:
&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial">&lt;Sender Name&gt;<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in"><span style="mso-fareast-font-family:
&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial">&lt;Sender Title&gt;</span><o:p></o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-autospace:none"><span style="font-family:&quot;Akzidenz-Grotesk Std Regular&quot;;
mso-bidi-font-weight:bold"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-autospace:none"><span style="font-family:&quot;Akzidenz-Grotesk Std Regular&quot;;
mso-bidi-font-weight:bold">Your American Red Cross Team <o:p></o:p></span></p>

